# Optional server-side 301 for math.uchicago.edu/~medvedev/
# Place in ~/public_html/ . Only takes effect if the department's Apache config
# allows .htaccess overrides; harmless if it doesn't.
#
# Scoped on purpose: only the directory root and index.html redirect, so
# Marko_Medvedev_Resume_2025.pdf, img/ and any other file stay reachable.
RedirectMatch 301 ^/~medvedev/(index\.html)?$ https://marko-medvedev.github.io/
